<h2 style="font-size: 28px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Examination Overview - NISM Series XII: Securities Markets Foundation Certification Mock Test</h2>
<br />

<p style="color: #000;"> The examination is designed to establish a foundational knowledge benchmark for individuals seeking to understand the structure and functioning of the Indian securities markets. It is ideal for beginners, students, entry-level professionals, and anyone looking to build a career in the financial services industry.<br>

<br>This certification aims to develop a clear understanding of key financial concepts, including various asset classes, market participants, financial instruments, primary and secondary markets, and the role of regulatory bodies such as the Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI). It ensures that candidates gain essential knowledge of trading, clearing and settlement processes, risk management practices, and the basic principles governing investment decisions.<br>

<br>By strengthening conceptual clarity around financial markets, investment products, regulatory framework, and market operations, the examination prepares candidates to make informed financial decisions and lays a strong foundation for advanced certifications in the securities market domain. It promotes financial literacy, ethical practices, and a better understanding of investor protection mechanisms within the Indian financial ecosystem.</p>

<h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Examination Objectives</h2>
<br />
<p style="color: #000;">
  On successful completion of the examination, the candidate should be able to:
</p>

<div>

  <p style="color: #000;">
    <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
    Know the basic structure, functions, and participants of the Indian securities markets, including the roles of various intermediaries and regulatory bodies.
  </p>

  <p style="color: #000;">
    <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
    Know the various processes involved in Primary and Secondary Markets
  </p>

  <p style="color: #000;">
    <img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />
    Understand the schemes and products in Mutual Funds and Derivatives Markets in India.
  </p>
</div>



